
    <article class="ss-comp" id="c-feedback" aria-labelledby="h-c-feedback">
      <div class="ss-comp-head"><h3 id="h-c-feedback">Empty, locked, error, popover, dialog, toast</h3><span class="pm-meta">D.16</span></div>
      <div class="ss-stage">
        <div class="ss-grid3">
          <div class="ss-card"><div class="pm-empty" style="padding:var(--pm-space-4)"><span class="pm-empty-glyph" aria-hidden="true"></span><p class="pm-empty-title">No projects yet.</p><p class="pm-empty-text">Start with an idea; Pramaan asks the rest.</p><button class="pm-btn pm-btn--quiet" type="button">New project</button></div></div>
          <div class="pm-locked"><span class="pm-pin" data-status="locked"><span class="pm-pin-head"><svg class="pm-pin-glyph" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#pm-g-lock"/></svg></span><span class="pm-pin-label">Locked</span></span><p class="pm-locked-title">Read only while sprint 1 is being built.</p><p>You can still:</p><ul class="pm-locked-list"><li><a href="#c-feedback">Read your decisions</a></li><li><a href="#c-feedback">Request a revision</a></li><li><a href="#c-feedback">Open Build</a> to see progress</li></ul></div>
          <div class="pm-error" role="alert"><span class="pm-pin" data-status="blocked"><span class="pm-pin-head"><svg class="pm-pin-glyph" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#pm-g-x"/></svg></span><span class="pm-pin-label">Blocked</span></span><p class="pm-error-title">The plan could not be saved.</p><p>The connection dropped. Try again; your text is kept.</p><button class="pm-btn pm-btn--quiet" type="button">Try again</button></div>
        </div>
        <div class="ss-row ss-row--top">
          <div><span class="ss-cap ss-cap--block">Popover (static copy)</span><div class="pm-popover pm-popover--static"><p class="pm-label">Comment on this passage</p><p class="pm-muted" style="margin:4px 0 12px">Your comments are sent together when you ask for changes.</p><textarea class="pm-textarea" aria-label="Comment"></textarea><div class="pm-dialog-actions"><button class="pm-btn pm-btn--quiet pm-btn--sm" type="button">Cancel</button><button class="pm-btn pm-btn--ink pm-btn--sm" type="button">Add comment</button></div></div></div>
          <div><span class="ss-cap ss-cap--block">Live: open each one</span><div class="ss-row"><button class="pm-btn pm-btn--quiet" type="button" popovertarget="c-pop2" id="c-pop-btn">Open popover</button><button class="pm-btn pm-btn--quiet" type="button" id="c-dlg-btn">Open dialog</button><button class="pm-btn pm-btn--quiet" type="button" id="c-toast-btn">Show toast</button></div></div>
          <div><span class="ss-cap ss-cap--block">Toast (static copy)</span><div class="pm-toast" role="status"><span class="pm-pin" data-status="done"><span class="pm-pin-head"><svg class="pm-pin-glyph" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#pm-g-check"/></svg></span><span class="pm-pin-label">Done</span></span><span>Draft 1 accepted. The plan opens next.</span><button class="pm-btn pm-btn--quiet pm-btn--sm" type="button">Undo</button></div></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <dl class="ss-notes"><dt>Anatomy</dt><dd>Empty: a 24px ring, a Heading sentence, one Body sentence, at most one quiet action. Locked: a pin, a Heading sentence and a three-item list of what you can still do. Error: what happened, why, what to try, inline, never a modal. Dialog: only for Stop this sprint and Delete this project. Toast: bottom left, 6 seconds, paused on hover.</dd><dt>Tokens</dt><dd class="pm-mono">--pm-shadow-float, --pm-shadow-dialog, --pm-sys-scrim, --pm-z-popover, -toast, -dialog</dd><dt>A11y</dt><dd>Popovers close on Escape and return focus. The toast is <span class="pm-mono">role="status"</span>. The error is <span class="pm-mono">role="alert"</span>. The dialog is a native modal.</dd></dl>
      <div class="ss-dd"><div class="ss-do"><span class="ss-do-label"><svg class="pm-icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#pm-g-check"/></svg>Do</span><span>The plan could not be saved. The connection dropped. Try again; your text is kept.</span></div><div class="ss-dont"><span class="ss-dont-label"><svg class="pm-icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#pm-g-x"/></svg>Don't</span><span class="ss-eg">Oops! Something went wrong.</span></div></div>
    </article>

    <article class="ss-comp" id="c-forms" aria-labelledby="h-c-forms">
      <div class="ss-comp-head"><h3 id="h-c-forms">Form controls</h3><span class="pm-meta">D.17</span></div>
      <p class="ss-lede">Type in the name field: the save button turns on, then the field confirms "Saved 14:10".</p>
      <div class="ss-stage ss-grid2">
        <div style="display:grid;gap:var(--pm-space-5)">
          <form class="pm-field" id="c-save-form" onsubmit="return false"><label class="pm-label" for="c-name">Project name</label><input class="pm-input" id="c-name" value="todo" autocomplete="off"><div class="pm-save"><button class="pm-btn pm-btn--quiet" type="button" id="c-save-btn" aria-disabled="true" aria-describedby="c-save-reason">Save name</button><span class="pm-btn-reason" id="c-save-reason">Nothing changed yet.</span><span class="pm-saved" id="c-saved" hidden><span class="pm-pin" data-status="done"><span class="pm-pin-head"><svg class="pm-pin-glyph" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#pm-g-check"/></svg></span><span class="pm-pin-label">Done</span></span>Saved 14:10</span></div></form>
          <div class="pm-field"><label class="pm-label" for="c-budget">Monthly budget</label><input class="pm-input" id="c-budget" value="20,000,000" inputmode="numeric"><span class="pm-help">18% used this month. Resets 1 October.</span><details class="pm-details"><summary>Details</summary><div class="pm-details-body">5,415,812 of 20,000,000 tokens this month</div></details></div>
          <div class="pm-field"><label class="pm-label" for="c-sort">Sort</label><select class="pm-select" id="c-sort"><option>Needs you first</option><option>Name</option><option>Last updated</option></select></div>
          <div class="pm-field"><label class="pm-label" for="c-note">Anything Pramaan should know?</label><textarea class="pm-textarea" id="c-note" placeholder="Say it the way you would tell a friend."></textarea></div>
        </div>
        <div style="display:grid;gap:var(--pm-space-5)">
          <div class="pm-field"><span class="pm-label">Hover, focus, error, disabled</span><input class="pm-input is-hover" aria-label="Hover" value="Hover state"><input class="pm-input is-focus" aria-label="Focus" value="Focus state"><input class="pm-input" aria-label="Error" aria-invalid="true" aria-describedby="c-e1" value=""><span class="pm-help pm-help--error" id="c-e1"><span class="pm-pin" data-status="blocked"><span class="pm-pin-head"><svg class="pm-pin-glyph" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#pm-g-x"/></svg></span><span class="pm-pin-label">Blocked</span></span>Give the project a name.</span><input class="pm-input" aria-label="Disabled" aria-disabled="true" readonly value="todo" aria-describedby="c-d1"><span class="pm-help" id="c-d1">You cannot rename a project while sprint 1 is being built.</span></div>
          <div class="ss-row"><label class="pm-checkbox"><input type="checkbox" checked> Send me a note when a draft is ready</label><label class="pm-checkbox"><input type="radio" name="c-r" checked> Two people</label><label class="pm-checkbox"><input type="radio" name="c-r"> One person</label></div>
          <div class="pm-switch-row"><input class="pm-switch" type="checkbox" role="switch" id="c-sw" aria-describedby="c-sw-t"><div><label class="pm-label" for="c-sw">Dependency monitoring</label><p class="pm-muted" id="c-sw-t">Monitoring is off for this project. Turn it on to see your dependencies and updates.</p></div></div>
          <div class="pm-switch-row"><input class="pm-switch" type="checkbox" role="switch" id="c-sw2" checked><div><label class="pm-label" for="c-sw2">Show requests</label><p class="pm-muted">Requests are shown in the live logs.</p></div></div>
          <p class="pm-pin" data-status="waiting"><span class="pm-pin-head"></span><span class="pm-pin-label">Waiting</span><span class="pm-pin-sentence">Export to GitHub is not available yet. Your code stays yours; take a copy any time.</span></p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <dl class="ss-notes"><dt>Anatomy</dt><dd>Label above, a 36px control, helper text below. Errors add a Blocked pin sentence in the helper. Disabled controls say why. The switch is 36 by 20 and states its consequence. Save buttons stay off with a reason until the value changes.</dd><dt>Tokens</dt><dd class="pm-mono">--pm-control-h, --pm-sys-control-border, --pm-sys-status-blocked, --pm-radius-control</dd><dt>A11y</dt><dd>Real labels, <span class="pm-mono">aria-invalid</span> and <span class="pm-mono">aria-describedby</span>. Checkboxes and radios use ink, not blue, through <span class="pm-mono">accent-color</span>.</dd></dl>
      <div class="ss-dd"><div class="ss-do"><span class="ss-do-label"><svg class="pm-icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#pm-g-check"/></svg>Do</span><span>18% used this month. Details: 5,415,812 of 20,000,000 tokens.</span></div><div class="ss-dont"><span class="ss-dont-label"><svg class="pm-icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#pm-g-x"/></svg>Don't</span><span class="ss-eg">A greyed Export to GitHub button with no explanation.</span></div></div>
    </article>

    <article class="ss-comp" id="c-log" aria-labelledby="h-c-log">
      <div class="ss-comp-head"><h3 id="h-c-log">Log viewer</h3><span class="pm-meta">D.17</span></div>
      <p class="ss-lede">Press Pause: the list stops and the banner counts the lines that arrive. Details opens the raw line.</p>
      <div class="ss-stage">
        <div class="pm-log" data-density="compact">
          <div class="pm-log-filters"><label class="pm-log-filter">Level <select class="pm-select"><option>All levels</option><option>Info</option><option>Warn</option><option>Error</option></select></label><label class="pm-log-filter">Project <select class="pm-select"><option>All projects</option><option>todo</option><option>test first</option></select></label><label class="pm-log-filter"><input class="pm-switch" type="checkbox" role="switch"> Show requests</label><button class="pm-btn pm-btn--quiet pm-btn--sm" type="button" data-log-pause aria-pressed="false">Pause</button><button class="pm-btn pm-btn--ghost pm-btn--sm" type="button" data-log-add>Demo: add a line</button></div>
          <p class="pm-log-count">Live · 69 lines · times are UTC</p>
          <div class="pm-log-paused"><span class="pm-pin" data-status="paused"><span class="pm-pin-head"><svg class="pm-pin-glyph" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#pm-g-bar"/></svg></span><span class="pm-pin-label">Paused</span><span class="pm-pin-sentence"><span data-log-new>0</span> new lines</span></span><button class="pm-btn pm-btn--quiet pm-btn--sm" type="button" data-log-resume>Resume</button></div>
          <ul class="pm-log-list" tabindex="0" aria-label="Log lines">
            <li class="pm-log-hour">21:00 UTC</li>
            <li class="pm-log-entry"><span class="pm-log-time">21:19:00</span><div class="pm-log-main"><span class="pm-log-level" data-level="info">INFO</span><span>Job finished: plan sprint</span><span class="pm-log-wire">builder.job.finished</span><button class="pm-btn pm-btn--ghost pm-btn--sm" type="button" data-toggle-target="c-raw-1" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="c-raw-1">Details</button></div><div class="pm-log-facts"><span class="pm-fact">job ddde3283 <button class="pm-copy" type="button" data-copy="ddde3283" aria-label="Copy job id"><svg class="pm-icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#pm-i-copy"/></svg></button></span><span class="pm-fact">todo</span><span class="pm-fact">95 s</span></div><pre class="pm-log-raw" id="c-raw-1" hidden>builder.job.finished job=ddde3283 project=todo kind=plan_sprint duration_s=95</pre></li>
            <li class="pm-log-entry"><span class="pm-log-time">21:19:01</span><div class="pm-log-main"><span class="pm-log-level" data-level="info">INFO</span><span>Code received from GitHub</span><span class="pm-log-wire">webhook.write.received</span></div><div class="pm-log-facts"><span class="pm-fact">push</span></div></li>
            <li class="pm-log-entry"><span class="pm-log-time">22:05:12</span><div class="pm-log-main"><span class="pm-log-level" data-level="warn">WARN</span><span>Job retried: build feature</span><span class="pm-log-wire">builder.job.retried</span></div><div class="pm-log-facts"><span class="pm-fact">implement_feature</span></div></li>
            <li class="pm-log-entry"><span class="pm-log-time">22:05:40</span><div class="pm-log-main"><span class="pm-log-level" data-level="error">ERROR</span><span>Job failed: check feature</span><span class="pm-log-wire">builder.job.failed</span></div><div class="pm-log-facts"><span class="pm-fact">check_feature</span></div></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
      <dl class="ss-notes"><dt>Anatomy</dt><dd>A filter row, a count sentence ("Live · 69 lines · times are UTC"), then the list as the one scroller. Each entry: a mono time, a level pin, the event in plain words with the wire event beside it, ids cut to 8 characters with a copy button, and Details for the raw line.</dd><dt>Tokens</dt><dd class="pm-mono">--pm-cmp-log-h, --pm-font-mono, [data-density="compact"]</dd><dt>A11y</dt><dd>The list is focusable and labelled. Copy buttons say what they copy and confirm with "Copied" for 2 seconds.</dd></dl>
      <div class="ss-dd"><div class="ss-do"><span class="ss-do-label"><svg class="pm-icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#pm-g-check"/></svg>Do</span><span>Job finished: plan sprint, with builder.job.finished beside it.</span></div><div class="ss-dont"><span class="ss-dont-label"><svg class="pm-icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#pm-g-x"/></svg>Don't</span><span class="ss-eg">A dark panel of raw lines with full 36-character ids.</span></div></div>
    </article>

    <article class="ss-comp" id="c-search" aria-labelledby="h-c-search">
      <div class="ss-comp-head"><h3 id="h-c-search">Search, chips, disclosure, skeleton</h3><span class="pm-meta">D.18</span></div>
      <div class="ss-stage">
        <div class="ss-row"><div class="pm-search"><svg class="pm-icon pm-search-icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#pm-i-search"/></svg><input class="pm-input" type="search" placeholder="Find a project" aria-label="Find a project"><button class="pm-btn pm-btn--ghost pm-btn--icon pm-btn--sm pm-search-clear" type="button" aria-label="Clear search"><svg class="pm-icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#pm-g-x"/></svg></button></div><div class="pm-search"><svg class="pm-icon pm-search-icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#pm-i-search"/></svg><input class="pm-input" type="search" value="todo" aria-label="Find a project, with text"><button class="pm-btn pm-btn--ghost pm-btn--icon pm-btn--sm pm-search-clear" type="button" aria-label="Clear search"><svg class="pm-icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#pm-g-x"/></svg></button></div><span class="pm-muted">2 of 9 match 'todo'</span></div>
        <div class="ss-row" role="group" aria-label="Filter"><button class="pm-chip" type="button" role="checkbox" aria-checked="true">Needs you</button><button class="pm-chip" type="button" role="checkbox" aria-checked="false">Working</button><button class="pm-chip is-hover" type="button" role="checkbox" aria-checked="false">Done</button><button class="pm-chip is-focus" type="button" role="checkbox" aria-checked="false">Paused</button><span class="ss-row"><button class="pm-chip" type="button" role="checkbox" aria-checked="false" aria-disabled="true" aria-describedby="c-r-chip">Locked</button><span class="pm-btn-reason" id="c-r-chip">No locked projects right now.</span></span></div>
        <div class="ss-grid2"><details class="pm-details" open><summary>Review advanced technical documents (4)</summary><div class="pm-details-body">System design, Data model, API specification, Test plan. <span class="pm-mono">pramaan-build/ui-test-52da6713</span></div></details><div class="pm-skeleton-lines" aria-hidden="true"><span class="pm-skeleton"></span><span class="pm-skeleton pm-skeleton--60"></span><span class="pm-skeleton pm-skeleton--40"></span></div></div>
      </div>
      <dl class="ss-notes"><dt>Anatomy</dt><dd>Search is a 36px field with a 16px icon and a clear button; the count in the title updates as you type. Chips are 28px and fill with ink when chosen. Disclosure summaries say Details in Label weight with a 12px chevron. The skeleton is sunken bars that pulse in opacity only.</dd><dt>Tokens</dt><dd class="pm-mono">--pm-radius-chip, --pm-sys-surface-sunken, --pm-motion-reveal</dd><dt>A11y</dt><dd>Chips are checkbox or radio roles. A disabled chip shows its reason. Reduced motion turns the pulse into a static bar.</dd></dl>
      <div class="ss-dd"><div class="ss-do"><span class="ss-do-label"><svg class="pm-icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#pm-g-check"/></svg>Do</span><span>0 of 9 match 'zzzz'. Clear search.</span></div><div class="ss-dont"><span class="ss-dont-label"><svg class="pm-icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#pm-g-x"/></svg>Don't</span><span class="ss-eg">A count that keeps saying 9 projects while a filter hides seven.</span></div></div>
    </article>
